    <edge id="E-VER-MOT-BUILD-ARTIFACTS" type="verifiedBy" from="MOT-BUILD-001" to="scripts/firmware.py#verify_artifacts" toKind="test" status="draft" createdBy="rqml">
      <notes>Executed after a fresh ESP32-C6 cross-build on 2026-11-07, exit 0. Checks artifacts, target and compiler metadata, generated configuration, ELF, and esptool image inspection. Manual negative fixtures rejected missing/empty images, invalid ELF, wrong target/compiler flags/configuration. Evidence and tested hashes are in .rqml/plan.md. Structural entry-point review complements this check; no hardware execution asserted.</notes>
    </edge>
